abstract: >-
  A/B evaluation report of J-Space V3.7 (inference-time cognitive control
  suite) on GLM-5.3-Flash across Terminal-Bench 2.1, DeepSWE, ALE,
  AutomationBench and HLE subsets, with GAIA-based efficiency measurements
  and reproduction across five model families. Identical model, environment,
  and sampling — only the J-Space toggle differs. The report is licensed
  under CC BY-ND 4.0: share and cite with attribution; do not modify or
  distribute derivative works.
